Package: litra-glow-backend
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Orkun Soylu <103385766+orkun-soylu@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6, libudev1, libgcc-s1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/timrogers/litra-rs
Description: litra CLI backend for the Litra Glow GNOME extension
 Bundles the prebuilt `litra` command-line tool from timrogers/litra-rs
 together with the udev rules required for non-root access to Logitech
 Litra Glow/Beam devices. This is the backend invoked by the Litra Glow
 GNOME Quick Settings extension, but the `litra` CLI is also usable on
 its own (litra on/off/brightness/temperature/devices).
